# The elven lineages, read off the Elven Lineages table. The
# trait's own text holds only the Level 1 column; the spells at
# levels 3 and 5 are printed in the table and nowhere else.

CATEGORY=Internal|Default.MOD	DEFINE:POOL_Elven_Lineage|0	DEFINE:POOL_Elven_Lineage_Spellcasting_Ability|0	DEFINE:POOL_Fiendish_Legacy|0	DEFINE:POOL_Fiendish_Legacy_Spellcasting_Ability|0	DEFINE:POOL_Draconic_Ancestry|0	DEFINE:POOL_Gnomish_Lineage|0	DEFINE:POOL_Gnomish_Lineage_Spellcasting_Ability|0	DEFINE:POOL_Giant_Ancestry|0
Drow	KEY:Elven Lineage ~ Drow	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ElvenLineage.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	BONUS:VAR|DarkvisionRange|120|TYPE=Base	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=1|Dancing Lights,ElvenLineageSpellDC	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Faerie Fire,ElvenLineageSpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=3	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Darkness,ElvenLineageSpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=5	DESC:The range of your Darkvision increases to 120 feet. You also know the Dancing Lights cantrip. At character level 3 you learn Faerie Fire. At character level 5 you learn Darkness.
High Elf	KEY:Elven Lineage ~ High Elf	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ElvenLineage.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=1|Prestidigitation,ElvenLineageSpellDC	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Detect Magic,ElvenLineageSpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=3	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Misty Step,ElvenLineageSpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=5	DESC:You know the Prestidigitation cantrip. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace that cantrip with a different cantrip from the Wizard spell list. At character level 3 you learn Detect Magic. At character level 5 you learn Misty Step.
Wood Elf	KEY:Elven Lineage ~ Wood Elf	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ElvenLineage.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	MOVE:Walk,35	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=1|Druidcraft,ElvenLineageSpellDC	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Longstrider,ElvenLineageSpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=3	SPELLS:Elven Lineage|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Pass without Trace,ElvenLineageSpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=5	DESC:Your Speed increases to 35 feet. You also know the Druidcraft cantrip. At character level 3 you learn Longstrider. At character level 5 you learn Pass without Trace.
Intelligence	KEY:Elven Lineage Spellcasting Ability ~ Intelligence	CATEGORY:Internal	TYPE:ElvenLineageSpellcastingAbility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1	BONUS:VAR|ElvenLineageSpellDC|8+Proficiency_Bonus+INT
Wisdom	KEY:Elven Lineage Spellcasting Ability ~ Wisdom	CATEGORY:Internal	TYPE:ElvenLineageSpellcastingAbility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1	BONUS:VAR|ElvenLineageSpellDC|8+Proficiency_Bonus+WIS
Charisma	KEY:Elven Lineage Spellcasting Ability ~ Charisma	CATEGORY:Internal	TYPE:ElvenLineageSpellcastingAbility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1	BONUS:VAR|ElvenLineageSpellDC|8+Proficiency_Bonus+CHA
Abyssal	KEY:Fiendish Legacy ~ Abyssal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:FiendishLegacy.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=1|Poison Spray,FiendishLegacySpellDC	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Ray of Sickness,FiendishLegacySpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=3	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Hold Person,FiendishLegacySpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=5	DESC:You have Resistance to Poison damage. You also know the Poison Spray cantrip. At character level 3 you learn Ray of Sickness. At character level 5 you learn Hold Person.
Chthonic	KEY:Fiendish Legacy ~ Chthonic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:FiendishLegacy.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=1|Chill Touch,FiendishLegacySpellDC	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|False Life,FiendishLegacySpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=3	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Ray of Enfeeblement,FiendishLegacySpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=5	DESC:You have Resistance to Necrotic damage. You also know the Chill Touch cantrip. At character level 3 you learn False Life. At character level 5 you learn Ray of Enfeeblement.
Infernal	KEY:Fiendish Legacy ~ Infernal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:FiendishLegacy.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=ATWILL|CASTERLEVEL=1|Fire Bolt,FiendishLegacySpellDC	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Hellish Rebuke,FiendishLegacySpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=3	SPELLS:Fiendish Legacy|TIMES=1|TIMEUNIT=Day|CASTERLEVEL=1|Darkness,FiendishLegacySpellDC|PRELEVEL:MIN=5	DESC:You have Resistance to Fire damage. You also know the Fire Bolt cantrip. At character level 3 you learn Hellish Rebuke. At character level 5 you learn Darkness.
Intelligence	KEY:Fiendish Legacy Spellcasting Ability ~ Intelligence	CATEGORY:Internal	TYPE:FiendishLegacySpellcastingAbility	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1	BONUS:VAR|FiendishLegacySpellDC|8+Proficiency_Bonus+INT
