Black	KEY:Draconic Ancestry ~ Black	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:DraconicAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.84	DESC:Your Breath Weapon deals Acid damage, and you have Resistance to Acid damage.
