Cloud’s Jaunt (Cloud Giant)	KEY:Giant Ancestry ~ Cloud’s Jaunt (Cloud Giant)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GiantAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:As a Bonus Action, you magically teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see.
Fire’s Burn (Fire Giant)	KEY:Giant Ancestry ~ Fire’s Burn (Fire Giant)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GiantAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:When you hit a target with an attack roll and deal damage to it, you can also deal 1d10 Fire damage to that target.
Frost’s Chill (Frost Giant)	KEY:Giant Ancestry ~ Frost’s Chill (Frost Giant)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GiantAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:When you hit a target with an attack roll and deal damage to it, you can also deal 1d6 Cold damage to that target and reduce its Speed by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.
Hill’s Tumble (Hill Giant)	KEY:Giant Ancestry ~ Hill’s Tumble (Hill Giant)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GiantAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:When you hit a Large or smaller creature with an attack roll and deal damage to it, you can give that target the Prone condition.
Stone’s Endurance (Stone Giant)	KEY:Giant Ancestry ~ Stone’s Endurance (Stone Giant)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GiantAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.85	DESC:When you take damage, you can take a Reaction to roll 1d12. Add your Constitution modifier to the number rolled and reduce the damage by that total.
Storm’s Thunder (Storm Giant)	KEY:Giant Ancestry ~ Storm’s Thunder (Storm Giant)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:GiantAncestry.SpecialQuality.Race Trait	SOURCEPAGE:SRD 5.2.1, p.86	DESC:When you take damage from a creature within 60 feet of you, you can take a Reaction to deal 1d8 Thunder damage to that creature.
